<title>UK: Eurofima sets 550 mln mark 10-year bond, +21 bp.</title>
<headline>Eurofima sets 550 mln mark 10-year bond, +21 bp.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers DG Bank and Goldman Sachs.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROFIMA</p>
<p> AMT    550 MLN DEM   COUPON     6.00	MATURITY    11.DEC.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.39     PAY DATE    11.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  32.5 BP   REOFFER    99.39     SPREAD	+21 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS SWITZ</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    20 BP     SELL CONC  12.5 BP   PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND APRIL 2006 BUND -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
